# C3: the std submodules mlmf-hf-config may name. DELIBERATELY EMPTY.
#
# This crate reads a `MetadataSource` and returns owned values and a static
# table. It needs nothing `std::`-rooted. The purity gate scans `src/` only,
# so the pinning test that reads files lives under tests/.
#
# The file exists rather than being absent because `purity.rs::allowed_std`
# panics when a gated member does not declare a list.
